#: appinstaller.rs:119
msgid "This file is not an app that can be installed here (.deb, .flatpak, .flatpakref or AppImage)."
msgstr "Ní aip é an comhad seo is féidir a shuiteáil anseo (.deb, .flatpak, .flatpakref nó AppImage)."

