#: appinstaller.rs:903
msgid "This app is installed already. Installing it again replaces it."
msgstr "Tá an aip seo suiteáilte cheana. Má shuiteálann tú arís í, cuirfear ina háit í."

#: appinstaller.rs:906
msgid "Apps from .deb packages become part of the system. When MAN is updated they are removed and need to be installed again. Flatpak apps and AppImages are kept."
msgstr "Éiríonn aipeanna ó phacáistí .deb mar chuid den chóras. Nuair a nuashonraítear MAN, baintear iad agus caithfear iad a shuiteáil arís. Coinnítear aipeanna Flatpak agus AppImages."

#: appinstaller.rs:909
msgid "Only install apps from sources you trust."
msgstr "Ná suiteáil aipeanna ach ó fhoinsí a bhfuil muinín agat astu."

#: appinstaller.rs:915
msgid "Where do you want to install {name}?"
msgstr "Cá háit ar mhaith leat {name} a shuiteáil?"

#: appinstaller.rs:920
msgid "Only your account can use the app."
msgstr "Ní féidir ach le do chuntas an aip a úsáid."

#: appinstaller.rs:921
msgid "Needs administrator rights."
msgstr "Tá cearta riarthóra ag teastáil."

#: appinstaller.rs:928
msgid "Only for Me"
msgstr "Dom Féin Amháin"

#: appinstaller.rs:928
msgid "For All Users of This Computer"
msgstr "Do Gach Úsáideoir ar an Ríomhaire Seo"

#: appinstaller.rs:943
msgid "This will take {size} of space on your computer."
msgstr "Tógfaidh sé seo {size} spáis ar do ríomhaire."

#: appinstaller.rs:945
msgid "The app is downloaded from {source}."
msgstr "Íoslódáiltear an aip ó {source}."

#: appinstaller.rs:947
msgid "The app is installed for all users of this computer."
msgstr "Suiteáiltear an aip do gach úsáideoir ar an ríomhaire seo."

#: appinstaller.rs:947
msgid "The app is installed only for you."
msgstr "Suiteáiltear an aip duit féin amháin."

#: appinstaller.rs:950
msgid "The AppImage is moved to {folder} and added to your apps."
msgstr "Bogtar an AppImage go {folder} agus cuirtear le d'aipeanna é."

#: appinstaller.rs:952
msgid "Click Install to install {name}."
msgstr "Cliceáil Suiteáil chun {name} a shuiteáil."

#: appinstaller.rs:958
msgid "Checking what else the app needs…"
msgstr "Ag seiceáil cad eile atá ag teastáil ón aip…"

#: appinstaller.rs:968
msgid "Also installs the packages it needs: {list}"
msgstr "Suiteálann sé na pacáistí atá ag teastáil uaidh freisin: {list}"

#: appinstaller.rs:974
msgid "Some packages the app needs are not available yet. Installing gets the newest package lists first; if they are still missing, the app cannot be installed."
msgstr "Níl roinnt pacáistí atá ag teastáil ón aip ar fáil fós. Faigheann an tsuiteáil na liostaí pacáistí is nuaí ar dtús; má tá siad fós ar iarraidh, ní féidir an aip a shuiteáil."

#: appinstaller.rs:1035
msgid "Installing {name}…"
msgstr "Ag suiteáil {name}…"

#: appinstaller.rs:1041
msgid "Preparing…"
msgstr "Ag ullmhú…"

#: appinstaller.rs:1048
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Sonraí"

#: appinstaller.rs:1088
msgid "Installing the package…"
msgstr "Ag suiteáil an phacáiste…"

