msgstr "Cailleadh an ceangal le cúntóir an chórais."

#: backend.rs:87
msgid "Authorization was cancelled."
msgstr "Cealaíodh an t-údarú."

#: backend.rs:87
msgid "Administrator rights are needed for this action."
msgstr "Teastaíonn cearta riarthóra don ghníomh seo."

#: backend.rs:89
msgid "The system helper stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Stop cúntóir an chórais gan choinne."

#: installer.rs:78
msgid "No EFI system partition"
msgstr "Níl aon deighilt chórais EFI ann"

#: installer.rs:82
msgid "Only {free} free, MAN needs {need}. Make more room with DUHACH! in Windows."
msgstr "Níl ach {free} saor, teastaíonn {need} ó MAN. Saor spás le DUHACH! i Windows."

#: installer.rs:83
msgid "No free space. Start DUHACH! in Windows to make room for MAN."
msgstr "Níl aon spás saor. Tosaigh DUHACH! i Windows chun spás a dhéanamh do MAN."

#: installer.rs:92
msgid "MAN is running from this disk"
msgstr "Tá MAN ag rith ón diosca seo"

#: installer.rs:96
msgid "In use: a partition is mounted"
msgstr "In úsáid: tá deighilt feistithe"

#: installer.rs:98
msgid "Too small, MAN needs {need}"
msgstr "Ró-bheag, teastaíonn {need} ó MAN"

#: installer.rs:108
msgid "Install MAN"
msgstr "Suiteáil MAN"

#: installer.rs:126
msgid "MAN is being installed. Please wait until it finishes."
msgstr "Tá MAN á shuiteáil. Fan go gcríochnóidh sé."

#: installer.rs:143
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Teanga"

#: installer.rs:155
msgid "_Restart in This Language"
msgstr "_Atosaigh sa teanga seo"

#: installer.rs:167
msgid "The live session restarts in the chosen language, and MAN is installed in it."
msgstr "Atosóidh an seisiún beo sa teanga a roghnaíodh, agus suiteálfar MAN inti."

#: installer.rs:213
msgid "Welcome to MAN"
msgstr "Fáilte go MAN"

#: installer.rs:214
msgid ""
"A fast, open and fully customizable GNOME system.\n"
"Install it on this computer, or keep exploring the live session."
msgstr ""
"Córas GNOME tapa, oscailte agus inoiriúnaithe go hiomlán.\n"
"Suiteáil ar an ríomhaire seo é, nó lean ort ag fiosrú an tseisiúin bheo."

#: installer.rs:218
msgid "_Install MAN…"
msgstr "_Suiteáil MAN…"

#: installer.rs:220
msgid "_Keep Trying MAN"
msgstr "_Lean ort ag triail MAN"

#: installer.rs:223
msgid "Looking for disks…"
msgstr "Dioscaí á lorg…"

#: installer.rs:250
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Fáilte"

#: installer.rs:265
msgid "This computer was started in legacy BIOS mode. MAN can only be installed on UEFI computers: restart and choose the UEFI boot option."
msgstr "Tosaíodh an ríomhaire seo i mód BIOS oidhreachta. Ní féidir MAN a shuiteáil ach ar ríomhairí UEFI: atosaigh agus roghnaigh an rogha tosaithe UEFI."

#: installer.rs:283
msgid "The system helper returned no disk information."
msgstr "Níor sheol cúntóir an chórais aon fhaisnéis faoi dhioscaí."

#: installer.rs:348
msgid "  ·  EFI"
msgstr "  ·  EFI"

#: installer.rs:356
msgid "_Next"
msgstr "_Ar aghaidh"

#: installer.rs:364
msgid "Erase Disk and Install MAN"
msgstr "Glan an diosca agus suiteáil MAN"

#: installer.rs:365
msgid "Everything on the chosen disk is deleted, Windows included."
msgstr "Scriosfar gach rud ar an diosca roghnaithe, Windows san áireamh."

#: installer.rs:365
msgid "Recommended. Everything on the chosen disk is deleted."
msgstr "Molta. Scriosfar gach rud ar an diosca roghnaithe."

#: installer.rs:369
msgid "Install Alongside Windows"
msgstr "Suiteáil taobh le Windows"

#: installer.rs:370
msgid "Recommended. MAN uses the free space next to Windows; Windows and its files stay. Choose the system at every start."
msgstr "Molta. Úsáideann MAN an spás saor taobh le Windows; fanann Windows agus a chuid comhad. Roghnaigh an córas gach uair a thosaíonn tú."

#: installer.rs:377
msgid "Reinstall MAN"
msgstr "Athshuiteáil MAN"

#: installer.rs:378
msgid "Replaces the system but keeps personal files in /home. The current system is saved as a snapshot."
msgstr "Cuireann sé córas nua in ionad an chórais ach coimeádann sé comhaid phearsanta i /home. Sábháiltear an córas reatha mar léargas."

#: installer.rs:383
msgid "Custom Partitions"
msgstr "Deighiltí saincheaptha"

#: installer.rs:383
msgid "For experts: choose partitions yourself, or create them with Disks."
msgstr "Do shaineolaithe: roghnaigh na deighiltí tú féin, nó cruthaigh iad le Dioscaí."

#: installer.rs:392
msgid "Disk"
msgstr "Diosca"

#: installer.rs:392
msgid "Choose the disk to erase. Disks that cannot be used are shown with the reason."
msgstr "Roghnaigh an diosca a ghlanfar. Taispeántar dioscaí nach féidir a úsáid in éineacht leis an gcúis."

#: installer.rs:418
msgid "No disks were found"
msgstr "Níor aimsíodh aon dioscaí"

#: installer.rs:425
msgid "Free Space Next to Windows"
msgstr "Spás saor taobh le Windows"

#: installer.rs:426
msgid "Windows' partitions are not touched. MAN shares the EFI system partition and adds Windows to its start menu."
msgstr "Ní dhéantar teagmháil le deighiltí Windows. Roinneann MAN deighilt chórais EFI agus cuireann sé Windows lena roghchlár tosaithe."

