#: installer.rs:554
msgid "Partitions"
msgstr "Deighiltí"

#: installer.rs:555
msgid "The system partition is formatted with Btrfs and holds @system, @home and @snapshots. Partitions on the disk MAN is running from are not listed."
msgstr "Formáidítear deighilt an chórais le Btrfs agus tá @system, @home agus @snapshots inti. Ní liostaítear deighiltí ar an diosca óna bhfuil MAN ag rith."

