msgid "Open Disks to create or resize partitions"
msgstr "Oscail Dioscaí chun deighiltí a chruthú nó a athmhéadú"

#: installer.rs:559
msgid "Refresh the partition list"
msgstr "Athnuaigh liosta na ndeighiltí"

#: installer.rs:567
msgid "Choose a partition"
msgstr "Roghnaigh deighilt"

#: installer.rs:579
msgid "EFI System Partition"
msgstr "Deighilt chórais EFI"

#: installer.rs:580
msgid "Format EFI System Partition"
msgstr "Formáidigh deighilt chórais EFI"

#: installer.rs:580
msgid "Leave off to keep boot loaders of other systems"
msgstr "Fág as chun lódálaithe tosaithe córas eile a choimeád"

#: installer.rs:582
msgid "System Partition (formatted as Btrfs)"
msgstr "Deighilt chórais (formáidithe mar Btrfs)"

#: installer.rs:583
msgid "Boot Partition (needed with encryption)"
msgstr "Deighilt tosaithe (riachtanach le criptiú)"

#: installer.rs:642
msgid "Partition list refreshed"
msgstr "Athnuadh liosta na ndeighiltí"

#: installer.rs:650
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Slándáil"

#: installer.rs:652
msgid "Encrypt the System"
msgstr "Criptigh an córas"

#: installer.rs:653
msgid "Protects your data if the computer is lost or stolen. A passphrase is asked at every start."
msgstr "Cosnaíonn sé do shonraí má chailltear nó má ghoidtear an ríomhaire. Iarrtar frása faire gach uair a thosaíonn sé."

#: installer.rs:656
msgid "Passphrase"
msgstr "Frása faire"

#: installer.rs:657
msgid "Confirm Passphrase"
msgstr "Deimhnigh an frása faire"

#: installer.rs:659
msgid "Keep this passphrase safe"
msgstr "Coimeád an frása faire seo slán"

#: installer.rs:660
msgid "If it is lost, the data cannot be recovered by anyone. The kernel and boot files stay on a small unencrypted boot partition."
msgstr "Má chailltear é, ní féidir le duine ar bith na sonraí a aisghabháil. Fanann an t-eithne agus comhaid tosaithe ar dheighilt tosaithe bheag gan chriptiú."

#: installer.rs:732
msgid "The passphrase needs at least 8 characters."
msgstr "Caithfidh 8 gcarachtar ar a laghad a bheith sa fhrása faire."

#: installer.rs:734
msgid "The passphrases do not match."
msgstr "Ní mheaitseálann na frásaí faire."

#: installer.rs:748
msgid "Choose a disk."
msgstr "Roghnaigh diosca."

#: installer.rs:758
msgid "Choose the disk with Windows."
msgstr "Roghnaigh an diosca ina bhfuil Windows."

#: installer.rs:767
msgid "Choose the installation to replace."
msgstr "Roghnaigh an tsuiteáil le hathsholáthar."

#: installer.rs:768
msgid "Unlock the encrypted installation first."
msgstr "Díghlasáil an tsuiteáil chriptithe ar dtús."

#: installer.rs:769
msgid "This partition holds no MAN system."
msgstr "Níl córas MAN sa deighilt seo."

#: installer.rs:776
msgid "Choose an EFI system partition."
msgstr "Roghnaigh deighilt chórais EFI."

#: installer.rs:778
msgid "Choose the system partition."
msgstr "Roghnaigh deighilt an chórais."

#: installer.rs:780
msgid "The EFI and system partitions must be different."
msgstr "Caithfidh an deighilt EFI agus deighilt an chórais a bheith difriúil."

#: installer.rs:782
msgid "Encryption needs a separate boot partition."
msgstr "Teastaíonn deighilt tosaithe ar leith don chriptiú."

#: installer.rs:791
msgid "The system partition must be at least {size}."
msgstr "Caithfidh deighilt an chórais a bheith {size} ar a laghad."

#: installer.rs:793
msgid "The EFI partition is not FAT formatted; turn on formatting."
msgstr "Níl an deighilt EFI formáidithe mar FAT; cas formáidiú air."

#: installer.rs:795
msgid "The system partition is mounted; unmount it in Disks first."
msgstr "Tá deighilt an chórais feistithe; díshuiteáil i nDioscaí í ar dtús."

#: installer.rs:817
msgid "Where Should MAN Be Installed?"
msgstr "Cá suiteálfar MAN?"

