msgstr "{free} spás saor (cruthaítear deighilt tosaithe agus deighilt an chórais)"

#: installer.rs:981
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: installer.rs:981
msgid "Not changed. It appears in MAN's start menu; the EFI system partition is shared."
msgstr "Gan athrú. Feictear é i roghchlár tosaithe MAN; roinntear deighilt chórais EFI."

