#: installer.rs:985
msgid "File System"
msgstr "Córas comhad"

#: installer.rs:986
msgid "Btrfs: @system for MAN, @home for your files, @snapshots for restore points. All share the free space."
msgstr "Btrfs: @system do MAN, @home do do chomhaid, @snapshots do phointí athchóirithe. Roinneann siad uile an spás saor."

#: installer.rs:991
msgid "System"
msgstr "Córas"

#: installer.rs:993
msgid "Your Account"
msgstr "Do chuntas"

#: installer.rs:994
msgid "Created in MAN Setup when the computer starts for the first time, together with the computer name, look and privacy settings."
msgstr "Cruthaítear é in MAN Setup nuair a thosaíonn an ríomhaire den chéad uair, mar aon le hainm an ríomhaire, an chuma agus socruithe príobháideachais."

#: installer.rs:998
msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "Méarchlár"

#: installer.rs:1002
msgid "All data on {model} ({path}) will be erased."
