msgid "The current system is replaced. Your files in /home are kept, and the old system is saved as a snapshot."
msgstr "Cuirtear córas nua in ionad an chórais reatha. Coimeádtar do chomhaid i /home, agus sábháiltear an seanchóras mar léargas."

